{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10412040","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10412040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1041204001:1":{"text":"여러분!","source_cn":"诸位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9723E22CC66530F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041204002:1":{"text":"으아악! 당신은 그 새 인간... 아, 아니에요. 치피는 아무 말도 안 했어요!","source_cn":"哇啊啊！你不是那个鸟人……不不不，满满什么也没说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944C9F7314220814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1041204002":{"text":"으아악! 당신은 그 새 인간... 아, 아니에요. 치피는 아무 말도 안 했어요!","source_cn":"哇啊啊！你不是那个鸟人……不不不，满满什么也没说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944C9F7314220814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041204003:1":{"text":"고생하신 여러분을 위해 제가 특별히 산 열매를 채집했습니다. 기력 회복에 좋은 열매죠!","source_cn":"诸位舟车劳顿，吾特意采集野果，可助汝等恢复精力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x510C644078F296A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041204004:1":{"text":"...햄스터 군, 제가 그렇게 무섭습니까?","source_cn":"……鼠君。吾，如此令你畏惧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87CFBF705B3B1A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041204005:1":{"text":"아... 아니에요! 치... 치피는 당신이 갑자기 튀어나와서 놀란 거예요!","source_cn":"没……没有啊！满满……满满只不过是没注意到你，才被吓了一跳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCD66564227871CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041204006:1":{"text":"...구구.","source_cn":"……咕唔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7A3B31EC3EA3FFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041204007:0":{"text":"열매는 잘 먹을게요. 고마워요, 카프라.","source_cn":"果子我们收下啦，谢谢你，卡夫拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC54E71274A9007E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041204008:1":{"text":"구...구.","source_cn":"咕……唔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5978B6959876BD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041204009:0":{"text":"저희랑 같이 먹을래요? 여기 자리 있어요.","source_cn":"怎么，你想和我们一起吃吗？这里还有空位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2FD0431CC6CDBDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041204010:1":{"text":"전... 다른...","source_cn":"吾……另有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FEDEB54B1AA437D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041204011:1":{"text":"아니... 안 돼, 안 돼!","source_cn":"不……不可，不可！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC913FED39363B60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1041204011":{"text":"아니... 안 돼, 안 돼!","source_cn":"不……不可，不可！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC913FED39363B60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041204012:1":{"text":"저, 전 두 햄스터 서머너님의 볼을 만지고 싶습니다!","source_cn":"吾、吾想触碰两位仓鼠使魔之面颊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CDF2DB9EB697E66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041204013:0":{"text":"...뭐, 뭐, 뭐라고요!!!","source_cn":"——什什什什么！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12223A8366746754","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041204014:1":{"text":"작고 부드러우면서 동글동글하고 깜찍한 두 햄스터 님은 세상에서 가장 귀여운 생명체예요!","source_cn":"两位仓鼠这般柔软娇小的生物，珠圆玉润，憨态可掬，实乃世...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF10E977E5CE021F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041204015:1":{"text":"전 가시나무의 부장관으로서 항상 엄숙함을 유지해야 하고 한시도 나태한 모습을 보여선 안 됩니다. 그래서 저와 가까이 지내고 싶어 하는 숲 사람들은 거의 없지요...","source_cn":"吾身为荆棘副官，需得时时肃穆，不可有片刻懈怠。丛林众人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96019C36850C50DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041204016:1":{"text":"기분 상하셨다면... 두 분께서 제 무례를 용서해 주시길 바랍니다!","source_cn":"若有冒犯……恳请两位，宽恕吾的无礼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5491047FE85570E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041204017:1":{"text":"아, 음...! 아이 참, 아무리 귀엽다고 칭찬하셔도 그런 요구는 좀...","source_cn":"呃，唔……！真、真是的，就算你夸我们可爱，这要求也实在是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25514FE84C880B9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041204018:1":{"text":"괜찮습니다. 무례한 부탁이었어요. 저도 거절당해 마땅하다고 생각했습니다!","source_cn":"无妨，遭拒在吾意料之中，本就是无礼请求！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30C2B1D68AE3862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041204019:1":{"text":"...아잇, 이왕 이렇게 된거 인심 쓰죠, 뭐! 치피, 우리 카프라 님과 악수하자!","source_cn":"……算了，豁出去了！满满，咱们和卡夫拉握握手吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5457F0725742B472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041204020:1":{"text":"무서워하지 마! 카프라 님은 무서운 사람이 아닌 것 같아! 햄스터를 잡아먹지도 않을 거고!","source_cn":"不要害怕！卡夫拉看起来不是那么可怕的人！也不会以仓鼠为食！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x752DD9A4D6EB0619","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1041204021:0":{"text":"아... 알겠어. 악수 정도라면 치피도... 용기를 내볼게!","source_cn":"好……好吧，只是握手的话，满满会……鼓足勇气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE684C12F40E980A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1041204022:0":{"text":"감사합니다. 제 소원이 오늘 드디어 이루어졌군요!","source_cn":"多谢诸位，吾的心愿，今日已近实现！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEEEAB6D93F7DD69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"하고 싶은 말이 뭐야? 속시원하게 말해!","source_cn":"你想说什么？大胆说出来！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA020BB61D97A70BE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하고 싶은 말이 뭐야? 속시원하게 말해!","female":"하고 싶은 말이 뭐야? 속시원하게 말해!","variant_male_record_index":"60942","variant_female_record_index":"60943","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"카프라, 여긴 어쩐 일이야?","source_cn":"卡夫拉，你怎么来了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA8D2BA2991CFCA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"카프라, 여긴 어쩐 일이야?","female":"카프라, 여긴 어쩐 일이야?","variant_male_record_index":"60